---
import ArrowRightSvg from "../components/ArrowRightSvg.astro";
---

<section class="relative mx-2 min-h-svh sm:mx-auto sm:max-w-7xl md:pt-0">
  <article
    class="z-10 flex min-h-svh flex-col justify-start gap-y-10 py-24 lg:py-52"
  >
    <header>
      <h1
        class="hero-h1-typo text-3xl leading-[1.1] font-bold tracking-tight text-primary sm:mb-4 sm:text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl"
      >
        AQUÍ NO ERES UN
      </h1>
      <h1
        class="hero-h1-typo2 mb-2 bg-linear-to-r from-secondary-hover/94 via-secondary/85 to-secondary/75 bg-clip-text pt-2 text-[3.2rem] leading-[0.9] font-black tracking-tighter text-transparent mobm:text-[3.8rem] mobl:text-6xl sm:text-7xl md:text-9xl lg:text-[12rem]"
      >
        EXPEDIENTE
      </h1>
      <p
        class="text-normal leading-relaxed font-medium text-pretty text-primary mobl:text-lg sm:text-lg md:text-xl lg:text-2xl xl:text-3xl"
      >
        Hablas directamente con nosotros. <span
          class="inline text-primary mobm:block sm:inline"
        >
          Precio cerrado sin sorpresas.</span
        >
        <span class="block text-primary"
          >Te respondemos hoy, no la semana que viene.</span
        >
      </p>
    </header>
    <footer
      class="flex w-full flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:gap-6"
    >
      <a
        target="_blank"
        href="https://wa.me/34613168703?text=Hola%20GC%20Abogados%2C%20estoy%20interesado%20en%20sus%20servicios.%20Me%20gustar%C3%ADa%20saber%20m%C3%A1s%20sobre%20c%C3%B3mo%20pueden%20ayudarme."
        class="group box-border flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-transparent bg-linear-to-r from-secondary-hover via-secondary/90 to-secondary/85 px-2 py-4 text-center text-base font-bold text-white shadow-lg hover:bg-secondary-hover hover:shadow-2xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-secondary-hover focus:outline-none sm:max-w-96 sm:px-6 sm:py-5 sm:text-lg"
        >Hablar por WhatsApp
        <ArrowRightSvg
          className="ml-2 transition-transform duration-350 group-hover:translate-x-2"
        />
      </a>
      <a
        href="#services"
        class="group box-border flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-transparent bg-white px-2 py-4 text-center text-base font-medium text-gray-900 shadow-lg outline-1 outline-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-100 hover:shadow-2xl focus:ring-1 focus:ring-secondary-hover focus:outline-none sm:max-w-96 sm:px-6 sm:py-5 sm:text-lg"
      >
        Trámites y precios
        <ArrowRightSvg
          className="ml-2 transition-transform duration-350 group-hover:rotate-90"
        />
      </a>
    </footer>
  </article>
</section>
